<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-12514] WAL don&apos;t flush several last records in LOG-ONLY/FSYNC mode if flush ptr=null</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12514</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In the current implementation, last flush pointer dependent to thread-local. If some thread adds new records and another thread calls wal.flush(null), this flush may not be flushed records witch was added in thread one, because in case null flush pointer, thread flushed until the last record which was added in current thread.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
